"text":"안","x":1233,"y":268,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"된다.","x":1276,"y":269,"width":67,"height":31},{"text":"업무적으~로","x":1360,"y":269,"width":163,"height":31},{"text":"10분","x":1537,"y":269,"width":73,"height":30}]},{"text":"이내 수행이 목표인 프로그램을 5분으로 단축하려고 병렬 처리 기법을 남용하지 말리는 뜻이다.","words":[{"text":"이내","x":178,"y":326,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"수행이","x":245,"y":324,"width":76,"height":33},{"text":"목표인","x":337,"y":324,"width":77,"height":31},{"text":"프로그램을","x":428,"y":324,"width":128,"height":31},{"text":"5분으로","x":569,"y":325,"width":92,"height":29},{"text":"단축하려고","x":675,"y":323,"width":130,"height":32},{"text":"병렬","x":819,"y":323,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":"처리","x":886,"y":322,"width":50,"height":32},{"text":"기법을","x":954,"y":322,"width":80,"height":32},{"text":"남용하지","x":1048,"y":320,"width":109,"height":33},{"text":"말리는","x":1175,"y":320,"width":89,"height":32},{"text":"뜻이다.","x":1280,"y":319,"width":100,"height":32}]},{"text":"야간이더라되 여러 팀에서 작성한 배치 프로그램이 동시에 수행되는 상황에서 특정 소수 배치 작업이 과도한","words":[{"text":"야간이더라되","x":212,"y":375,"width":165,"height":33},{"text":"여러","x":390,"y":374,"width":48,"height":31},{"text":"팀에서","x":453,"y":374,"width":73,"height":31},{"text":"작성한","x":541,"y":374,"width":77,"height":31},{"text":"배치","x":628,"y":373,"width":49,"height":31},{"text":"프로그램이","x":690,"y":373,"width":128,"height":31},{"text":"동시에","x":832,"y":373,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"수행되는","x":924,"y":372,"width":108,"height":33},{"text":"상황에서","x":1044,"y":371,"width":108,"height":32},{"text":"특정","x":1167,"y":370,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"소수","x":1238,"y":371,"width":62,"height":30},{"text":"배치","x":1313,"y":370,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"작업이","x":1390,"y":369,"width":94,"height":33},{"text":"과도한","x":1502,"y":369,"width":108,"height":31}]},{"text":"병렬 처리를 시도한다면 CPU, 메모리, 디스크 등 지원에 대한 경합 때문에 오히려 전체 배치 수행 시간이 늘어날","words":[{"text":"병렬","x":180,"y":426,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"처리를","x":245,"y":426,"width":77,"height":31},{"text"